    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS</h2><br>[/h2]<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609570/extras/58958f993ac1777fbe219a342d6efab3.avif?t=1711118563\" width=211 height=115 /></span><br><br>In a universe where bugs and forest creatures lead busy lives and have jobs, there exists the tranquil town of Fungi, where Pepo, Ross, and Hope reside, three friends who will together be the protagonists of this adventure. Upon joining the Beetle Adventurer Guild, the troupe receives an important mission, and to complete it, the player will have to leave the town and confront various enemies and challenges.<br><br>Explore the world and learn about the characters, battle against unique and cute enemies to unlock new areas, engage in conversations with characters, and directly influence their future by completing side quests.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS</h2><br>[/h2]<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609570/extras/58958f993ac1777fbe219a342d6efab3.avif?t=1711118563\" width=211 height=115 /></span><br><br>In a universe where bugs and forest creatures lead busy lives and have jobs, there exists the tranquil town of Fungi, where Pepo, Ross, and Hope reside, three friends who will together be the protagonists of this adventure. Upon joining the Beetle Adventurer Guild, the troupe receives an important mission, and to complete it, the player will have to leave the town and confront various enemies and challenges.<br><br>Explore the world and learn about the characters, battle against unique and cute enemies to unlock new areas, engage in conversations with characters, and directly influence their future by completing side quests.",
    "short_description": "A RPG with cute forest creatures that venture out exploring the world!",
